---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About AI Playbook" description="The honest AI tool review platform. We test, score, and compare AI tools across 5 dimensions.">
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-6">About AI Playbook</h1>

    <div class="prose prose-gray max-w-none">
      <h2>Why We Built This</h2>
      <p>
        The AI tools landscape is exploding. Thousands of new tools launch every month.
        But most "review" sites just list tools — they don't actually test them.
      </p>
      <p>
        AI Playbook exists to fix that. We test every tool hands-on, score them across
        5 dimensions, and tell you not just what a tool <em>claims</em> to do, but what it
        <em>actually</em> does — and whether it's worth your money.
      </p>

      <h2>Our Rating System</h2>
      <p>Every tool is scored (1-10) across these dimensions:</p>
      <ol>
        <li><strong>Ease of Use</strong> — How intuitive is the interface? How fast can you get started?</li>
        <li><strong>Features</strong> — Depth and breadth of functionality.</li>
        <li><strong>Value for Money</strong> — What you get vs. what you pay.</li>
        <li><strong>Performance</strong> — Speed, accuracy, reliability in real use.</li>
        <li><strong>Support & Ecosystem</strong> — Documentation, community, integrations, API.</li>
      </ol>

      <h2>Honest Reviews, Always</h2>
      <p>
        We don't accept payment for reviews. Affiliate commissions help fund our work,
        but our ratings are never influenced by commercial relationships.
        When we say a tool is good (or bad), we mean it.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Have a tool you'd like us to review? Found an inaccuracy? 
        <a href="mailto:hello@aiplaybook.guide">Get in touch</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
